{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19112","headline":"蒙恩转仪曹郎依前充集贤学士举韩潮州自代因寄七言 · 刘禹锡","name":"蒙恩转仪曹郎依前充集贤学士举韩潮州自代因寄七言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翔鸾阙下谢恩初，通籍由来在石渠。\n暂入南宫判祥瑞，还归内殿阅图书。\n故人犹在三江外，同病凡经二纪余。\n今日荐君嗟久滞，不惟文体似相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}